    "  Unova quest E28 (Pokemon show/hairstyle unlock -- choices,",
    "  self_switch gated, system messages with \\C[3]\\PN).",
    "  Rewritten: E24 (shopper NPC), E25 (Pokemon cry -- kept",
    "  as cry), E27 (gem trivia NPC).",
    "",
    "Map 87 (Fuchsia house -- massage):",
