    "  E7 (garbage pile).",
    "  Preserved: E6 (Machoke cry), E8 (Abra cry),",
    "  E10 (Pokemon cry).",
    "",
    "Map 481 (Fuchsia house -- Hidden Ability):",
    "  Preserved: E5 Hidden Ability tutorial/quest (9 blocks --",
    "  choices, variable references \\V[1], mechanical info about",
    "  HA spawns -- quest-critical), E6 (sleeping Pokemon).",
    "  Rewritten: E4 (garbage pile).",
    "",
    "Map 485 (Safari Area 3):",
