    "481": {
      "name": "Fuchsia City (House -- Hidden Ability)",
      "events": {
        "5": {
          "name": "EV005 -- HA Tutorial NPC",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Oh.. A Pokémon trainer.",
                    "Please do try to keep your",
                    "voice down to not disturb",
                    "my sleeping Musharna."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Tell me, do you know about",
                    "Hidden Abilities?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 6,
                  "type": "choices",
                  "choices": [
                    "Yes",
                    "No"
                  ],
                  "cancel_type": 2
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 9,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I would assume no less from",
                    "a young, accomplished",
                    "Pokémon trainer such as",
                    "yourself."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 14,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Very rarely, some Pokémon",
                    "are born with a different ",
                    "ability from the other",
                    "members of their species."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 17,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "In some cases, this can",
                    "make them extremely",
                    "valuable to Pokémon",
                    "trainers."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 24,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Thanks to my trusty",
                    "Musharna's ability to peek",
                    "into the Dream World, I am",
                    "able to locate Pokémon with",
                    "rare abilities."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 29,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Right now, I can detect",
                    "that some of the Pokémon",
                    "around \\C[1]<b>\\V[1]</b>\\C[0]",
                    "might have their hidden",
                    "ability..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 32,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Hidden ability Pokémon",
                    "rarely stay in the same",
                    "spot for long, so you",
                    "should head there quickly",
                    "if you want a chance of",
                    "catching one."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "6": {
          "name": "EV006 -- Sleeping Pokemon",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 0,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The Pokémon is sleeping",
                    "softly... Better not",
                    "disturb it!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "4": {
